        {
          "text": "Basalale kubusyu bwa-Leza wabo, kuti batasofwaazyi izina lyaLeza wabo, nkaambo mbembabo batuula zipaizyo zitentelwa Jehova, zilyo zya-Leza wabo, aboobo baleelede kusalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
