        {
          "text": "Batakwati mwanakazi simamambe nanka iwakasofwaazigwa; batakwati mwanakazi iwakalekana amulumaakwe; nkaambo mupaizi ulasalala kumeso aa-Leza wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.7",
